"Amazon.com, Inc.",E-commerce,E-commerce Marketplace,"Pricing Algorithm (""Project Nessie"") & Buy Box Ranking",Structural self-preferencing; algorithmic conditioning of marketplace visibility tied to Fulfillment by Amazon (FBA) usage; testing competitor price elasticity to inflate baseline clearing prices.,"FTC v. Amazon.com, Inc., No. 2:23-cv-01495 (W.D. Wash. 2023)",FTC Act Section 5 (Unfair Methods of Competition); Sherman Act Section 2 (Monopolization),Amazon Services Business Solutions Agreement (BSA) Section 3: Unilateral termination and fund-freezing without judicial review.,1,Antitrust / Monopoly,Ongoing,Pending,Litigated Precedent
